Judgment 包括：

```text
section_type
material_disclosure
potential_risk
missing_support
requires_review
```

---

## Transaction Review

不要设计成：

```text
分析这笔交易有没有问题。
```

拆成：

```text
transaction_type
related_party_probability
business_relevance
description_consistency
round_trip_risk
unusual_amount
unusual_frequency
requires_review
